</pubDate><guid>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/galleries/honduras/</guid><description/></item><item><title>About</title><link>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi there,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to my photography website. Here you&amp;rsquo;ll find a collection of places, people, and moments I wanted to remember from my travels.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;What I love about photography is the way it allows me to crystallize the feeling of discovering somewhere new, from its atmosphere and character to the details that make it memorable.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I particularly enjoy exploring the relationship between people and their surroundings. I focus on how places can shape people&amp;rsquo;s emotions and perceptions, but also how people bring their own emotions and stories into the places they inhabit. I try to convey something of that relationship, as well as the sensations I feel while exploring.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>